+ do infer-tracked-name Found
    - id SyntaxId
    - name Atom
    - want Want

` A name alone read as tracked: a member of the receiver, read as any member is and tracked
` as `track-read` says, a member of a markup element being built, read as `read-received`
` says and tracked so too, or a local, tracked as `track-local` says. A global can not be
` tracked, as the reference reports, nor can `this`, which is no property. Any other name has no
` shape here yet.
